      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY TROJAN (7) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 1.5 lengths into third (18.05) at Richmond Straight in a Mix 2/3 over 324m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Expected to feature in the finish again. EARLY CONCRETE (5) steps out for the first time at this course. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 2.5 lengths (20.28) at Gunnedah. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Expected to run well. REIKO BATTY (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (23.81) last time in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Form here sound including two wins. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Should be in this for a long way. DESPICABLE MILO (4) can fill a top-three spot.",
